MS_Teams_Transcript.vtt (Microsoft Teams)
Pros
Unique IDs: Each caption block has a unique identifier, useful for referencing or syncing.
Speaker Names: Sometimes includes names in the dialogue, though not as explicit as a dedicated speaker label.
More Polished: Fewer filler words, more concise and formal language.
Consistent Formatting: Segments are longer and often combine related sentences, which can improve context.
Cons
Longer Segments: Some captions are long, which may be harder to read quickly.
No Explicit Speaker Labels: Like Amazon, does not use a dedicated speaker label field.
Less Conversational: Feels more edited, which may lose some nuances of natural speech.
Formatting: Uses comma-separated numbers in currency (e.g., ₹1,00,000), which may not be standard everywhere.



